      {
        "answer": "Yes, after all effects and attacks resolve, it becomes your turn.",
        "question": "During my opponent's turn, a Digimon with this digivolution card is deleted, and this card's inherited effect moves the memory gauge to 1 on my side. Is it now my turn?",
